1
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:20,360
Come in.

2
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:24,240
Mr. Lin.

3
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:25,720
Brother Wang.

4
00:01:27,520 --> 00:01:28,520
Come, have a seat.

5
00:01:31,039 --> 00:01:32,160
Your office

6
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:34,240
is so smoky. Why don't you open a window?

7
00:01:34,240 --> 00:01:35,120
I'm used to it.

8
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:36,160
This atmosphere

9
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:37,960
calms my mind.

10
00:01:40,479 --> 00:01:41,160
Mr. Lin.

11
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:44,160
About the Chenguang Processing Plant last time,

12
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:44,960
I offended you.

13
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:46,360
I hope you can forgive me.

14
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:49,120
It's in the past.

15
00:01:49,240 --> 00:01:50,440
Let's not mention it.

16
00:01:51,479 --> 00:01:52,840
I just made some black tea.

17
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:55,120
In winter, drinking black tea warms the stomach.

18
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:55,800
Have a seat first.

19
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:55,960
Okay.

20
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:58,289
I'll get the Korean pine material for you.

21
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:35,800
Mr. Lin,

22
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:38,160
your office is so elegant.

23
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:40,420
It's full of calligraphy and paintings.

24
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:42,280
You have a good eye, Brother Wang.

25
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,560
Every item in this room

26
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,800
was handpicked by me.

27
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:45,240
Come.

28
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:54,440
This one

29
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:56,480
was chosen according to your requirements.

30
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:58,960
It's aged Korean pine, over 15 years old.

31
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,420
There are no knots,

32
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:01,760
and no bug holes.

33
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:03,840
Mr. Lin,

34
00:03:04,720 --> 00:03:06,440
this is indeed good material.

35
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,930
It's at least ten years old.

36
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:12,880
But,

37
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:15,440
where did you get it?

38
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:18,079
Brother Wang, what a coincidence.

39
00:03:18,079 --> 00:03:19,640
This ten-year-old material,

40
00:03:19,640 --> 00:03:21,300
I actually managed to find it.

41
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:38,079
It's a bit dry.

42
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,200
Brother Wang.

43
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:44,720
How long has it been

44
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:47,040
since you last returned to Xinchun?

45
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:49,130
You must be joking, Mr. Lin.

46
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:50,760
I have never been to Xinchun.

47
00:03:51,440 --> 00:03:52,160
Is that so?

48
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:56,040
Why do you look so familiar to me, Brother Wang?

49
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:59,160
I remember when we first met.

50
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,040
Right.

51
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:01,880
It was right in the workshop of our factory.

52
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:03,210
The first time I saw you,

53
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,900
I felt a sense of familiarity.

54
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,260
It seems like you resemble

55
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,920
an old friend.

56
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:14,040
When I first met you, Mr. Lin,

57
00:04:15,160 --> 00:04:19,490
I also thought you looked exactly like an acquaintance of mine in Jiangcheng.

58
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:22,840
Mr. Lin.

59
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:24,280
I have an appointment this afternoon.

60
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:25,440
I won't bother you any longer.

61
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:27,100
Please take care of yourself.

62
00:04:28,080 --> 00:04:28,810
I'm leaving.

63
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:35,930
I forgot the sample.

64
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:39,080
Also,

65
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:40,640
like I said,

66
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:41,920
in Xinchun,

67
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:43,680
no matter what difficulties you face

68
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:45,120
or if you need any help,

69
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:46,340
come to me anytime.

70
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:47,159
Anytime.

71
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:48,640
Don't worry, Mr. Lin.

72
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:49,880
I'm in Xinchun.

73
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,220
I'm doing fine.

74
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:52,820
I won't see you out.

75
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:03,800
Come in.

76
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:09,800
Mr. Lin,

77
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:11,080
Mr. Wang has left.

78
00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:12,040
He left.

79
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:14,160
Look, Mr. Lin,

80
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:14,960
I have to say,

81
00:05:14,960 --> 00:05:17,080
you should stop smoking if you can't handle it.

82
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:18,000
Alright, alright.

83
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:20,200
I know my own body.

84
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:21,180
Okay, okay.

85
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,160
Well,

86
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:23,280
Mr. Lin, do you think

87
00:05:23,280 --> 00:05:24,760
Mr. Wang is the one from back then?

88
00:05:24,760 --> 00:05:27,360
Let's hold off on the Russian mahogany for now.

89
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:28,650
Take it easy.

90
00:05:29,760 --> 00:05:31,120
All right, then I'll...

91
00:05:32,080 --> 00:05:33,480
I'll be quiet for a while.

92
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:34,280
Listen to me.

93
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:35,080
Stop smoking.

94
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,640
It's bad for your health.

95
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:37,770
Leave the door open.

96
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:45,680
Yes.

97
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,480
The handwriting doesn't match.

98
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:52,370
See you at the hair salon later.

99
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:00,460
Finished talking?

100
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:01,240
Done.

101
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:03,720
I have to go to the forestry center this afternoon.

102
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:04,580
What about you?

103
00:06:05,280 --> 00:06:07,280
I happen to have something to do too.

104
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:09,160
Stay safe.

105
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,680
Don't worry about me.

106
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:26,260
Could there be clues here?

107
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:28,690
That old man wouldn't trick us, right?

108
00:06:30,400 --> 00:06:31,800
We've been wandering around for two days.

109
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,260
We haven't seen anything.

110
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:37,420
This illegal timber has to be transported down.

111
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,170
There must be a road.

112
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:40,980
If we come at night,

113
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:44,250
we won't be able to tell directions at all.

114
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:46,409
While it's still light out,

115
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:47,920
let's get more familiar with the area.

116
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,480
Give me a break.

117
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:52,920
My feet are frozen numb.

118
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,040
Itching for a beating?

119
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,280
I can... I can walk.

120
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:58,640
I can walk. I can walk.

121
00:06:58,640 --> 00:06:59,120
Let me loosen it for you.

122
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:00,050
No need, no need.

123
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:46,920
Li Xuefei.

124
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:51,340
What are you doing here alone?

125
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:53,840
Officer Cao, what brings you here?

126
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:55,170
We are police officers.

127
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:57,610
We go everywhere when handling cases.

128
00:07:58,360 --> 00:07:59,800
But Miss Li,

129
00:08:00,280 --> 00:08:01,520
in this wilderness,

130
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:02,610
why are you here?

131
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:05,440
My family is in the timber business.

132
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:07,100
I go wherever there is timber.

133
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,400
I was just passing by

134
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:09,480
and saw a wooden cabin here.

135
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:11,540
I was curious, so I came to take a look.

136
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:17,240
Teng Xiaohu hasn't been caught yet.

137
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,810
He might be hiding somewhere around here.

138
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,580
You're alone and it's remote.

139
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,080
Don't wander around.

140
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:24,320
You have a point, Officer Cao.

141
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:25,760
I'll be careful from now on.

142
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:26,600
Head down the mountain soon.

143
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:27,660
It'll be dark soon.

144
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:28,520
Okay.

145
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,960
I carefully studied

146
00:08:56,960 --> 00:09:00,240
the ledger brought back from Teng Laohu's office last night.

147
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:02,400
It records some times and locations,

148
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:04,040
but it lacks

149
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:06,440
transaction details and specific amounts.

150
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:08,240
If we can find their base,

151
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:09,600
maybe

152
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:12,250
we can track down that batch of timber.

153
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,160
On here,

154
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:16,520
the most frequently recorded location

155
00:09:16,520 --> 00:09:18,250
is this Shuilin Forestry Farm.

156
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:21,330
The latest transaction record was five days ago.

157
00:09:21,800 --> 00:09:22,530
Third Uncle,

158
00:09:22,880 --> 00:09:24,920
these three kilometers, five kilometers,

159
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:26,580
and the circles drawn on here,

160
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:28,000
do you have any clues?

161
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:33,560
This circle should be a marker.

162
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:36,760
Three kilometers and five kilometers are definitely distances.

163
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:37,960
The forest is too big,

164
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,220
and has no place names.

165
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:43,640
Usually, only the direction and distance from the marker are recorded.

166
00:09:43,640 --> 00:09:44,840
Then what exactly

167
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:46,800
does this marker look like?

168
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:48,360
I am not familiar with

169
00:09:49,040 --> 00:09:50,120
Shuilin Forestry Farm.

170
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:52,320
I am. I know Shuilin Forestry Farm well.

171
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:54,760
Familiar? What are you familiar with?

172
00:09:54,760 --> 00:09:55,480
Familiar?

173
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:56,840
Even my brother can't figure it out.

174
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:58,640
Do you think you can make sense of it?

175
00:09:58,640 --> 00:09:59,520
Sorry,

176
00:09:59,680 --> 00:10:00,800
but I'm a high school student.

177
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:01,920
I have a higher education than you,

178
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:02,920
and a higher IQ.

179
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:06,120
You're so capable.

180
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,280
You're the most capable.

181
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:08,400
Every single day.

182
00:10:08,680 --> 00:10:11,200
Isn't this circle that big rock?

183
00:10:11,560 --> 00:10:12,480
What big rock?

184
00:10:12,760 --> 00:10:13,680
How do you know?

185
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:15,240
The wood from my mom's factory

186
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,480
all comes from there.

187
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:18,480
There's a big rock in there.

188
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:21,040
Do you know the exact location?

189
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:23,320
I don't remember the exact location,

190
00:10:23,640 --> 00:10:25,100
but I know how to get there.

191
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:25,920
I'll go stake it out.

192
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:26,400
No.

193
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,480
It's too dangerous. You can't go.

194
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:29,680
What's so dangerous?

195
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,120
I run really fast.

196
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:31,880
If I run into danger,

197
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:32,940
I'll just run away.

198
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:37,440
I'll go with you.

199
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:38,730
Okay, but remember,

200
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:40,040
follow my orders.

201
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:41,240
Uncle San,

202
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:43,440
you keep an eye on Teng Laohu.

203
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:44,600
Ergui,

204
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:46,800
don't slack off on the forum either.

205
00:10:46,800 --> 00:10:48,160
Don't worry, bro.

206
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:49,880
I've been keeping an eye on the forum.

207
00:10:49,880 --> 00:10:52,080
I'll let you know immediately if anything happens.

208
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:52,840
You two,

209
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,320
stay safe.

210
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:56,480
It's cold in the woods, so bundle up.

211
00:10:56,560 --> 00:10:57,890
Don't worry, Uncle San.

212
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:58,960
If there's any danger,

213
00:10:58,960 --> 00:11:00,640
I'll grab Uncle Wang and run.

214
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:03,160
Why can't you tell good words from bad?

215
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:04,720
Didn't you notice

216
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:06,040
that Uncle wasn't talking to bro,

217
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:07,160
but to you?

218
00:11:07,560 --> 00:11:08,040
You...

219
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,140
Uncle Wang,

220
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:13,530
when are we leaving?

221
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,280
Tonight.

222
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:15,680
Dr. Song.

223
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:17,440
Old man Li across the hall is having another attack.

224
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:18,720
Please go check on him quickly.

225
00:12:18,720 --> 00:12:19,680
Okay, let me grab something.

226
00:12:19,680 --> 00:12:20,520
He looks like he's dying.

227
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:21,580
Please hurry over.

228
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:22,240
Okay.

229
00:12:24,160 --> 00:12:24,890
Don't forget

230
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:25,920
to bring me the stethoscope

231
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:27,160
on my desk.

232
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,320
Okay, Dr. Song.

233
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:38,300
Why are you back again?

234
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:40,400
Didn't you promise me you'd never come back?

235
00:12:40,400 --> 00:12:42,130
Are you trying to get me killed?

236
00:12:43,160 --> 00:12:44,480
And you picked the lock.

237
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,680
What did you take?

238
00:12:45,680 --> 00:12:46,640
Take it out.

239
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:47,280
Manman.

240
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:49,970
I really can't give this to you.

241
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:51,680
It can save my life, you know?

242
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,540
Give me a little more time.

243
00:12:56,160 --> 00:12:57,360
Once I settle this,

244
00:12:57,760 --> 00:12:59,360
I'll come back and marry you.

245
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:01,220
If my dad still disagrees,

246
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,640
I'll cut ties with him.

247
00:13:02,640 --> 00:13:04,040
I still have to marry you.

248
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:05,720
Xiaoman.

249
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:07,640
What are you dawdling for?

250
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:09,100
Where is the stethoscope?

251
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:10,560
Right away, Dr. Song.

252
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:12,200
Teng Xiaohu.

253
00:13:12,800 --> 00:13:13,880
Let me tell you,

254
00:13:14,200 --> 00:13:16,440
it's been over between us for a long time.

255
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:18,440
I'll pretend I didn't see you today.

256
00:13:18,560 --> 00:13:20,090
Don't ever come back again.

257
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:27,440
This is the last time.

258
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:29,280
From today on, we are even.

259
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:36,580
Hello, Xuefei.

260
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:39,980
There's something I want you to look into for me.

261
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:41,440
In Lin Shengli's hands,

262
00:13:41,440 --> 00:13:43,680
a batch of old materials suddenly appeared.

263
00:13:43,680 --> 00:13:44,480
I want to know

264
00:13:44,680 --> 00:13:45,720
how he got them.

265
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:49,320
I got it.

266
00:13:53,640 --> 00:13:55,840
Did you remember everything I told you?

267
00:13:55,880 --> 00:13:56,840
I know.

268
00:13:57,160 --> 00:13:58,640
I can't act before you do,

269
00:13:58,640 --> 00:13:59,880
and I must follow your orders.

270
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:02,610
How many times have you said that this afternoon?

271
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:09,720
Uncle Wang.

272
00:14:09,880 --> 00:14:11,800
What exactly did you and my mom talk about

273
00:14:11,800 --> 00:14:13,530
at the dinner table that night?

274
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:18,920
Don't hide it from me.

275
00:14:18,920 --> 00:14:20,000
I know everything.

276
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:21,120
What do you know?

277
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:23,080
You guys have a secret

278
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:24,160
and won't tell me.

279
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:27,260
If I told you, it wouldn't be a secret.

280
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:30,400
Kids shouldn't meddle in adults' business.

281
00:14:30,400 --> 00:14:31,840
Come on, tell me.

282
00:14:32,400 --> 00:14:33,320
Tell me.

283
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:34,600
Sometimes,

284
00:14:35,200 --> 00:14:37,160
not telling you is actually helping you.

285
00:14:37,160 --> 00:14:38,280
Just listen to your mom

286
00:14:38,280 --> 00:14:39,200
and study hard.

287
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:41,000
Not this again.

288
00:14:41,280 --> 00:14:42,160
I'm not going.

289
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:44,120
I just want to stay in Xinchun.

290
00:14:44,560 --> 00:14:45,400
What's wrong with you guys?

291
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:47,000
You all want to drive me away.

292
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:49,480
In life,

293
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:51,240
you always have to go out and see the world.

294
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:52,370
You don't have to go,

295
00:14:52,720 --> 00:14:54,480
but you need to have the capital to do so.

296
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,360
Understand?

297
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:57,760
Stop it.

298
00:14:59,320 --> 00:14:59,880
Brother.

299
00:15:00,920 --> 00:15:02,120
Keep your voice down.

300
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:05,400
Keep your voice down. Why are you here?

301
00:15:05,400 --> 00:15:06,160
What's wrong?

302
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:06,840
No, I didn't want to come.

303
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:08,320
Third Uncle insisted on dragging me here.

304
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,580
He said he felt uneasy.

305
00:15:10,040 --> 00:15:11,000
Teng Laohu

306
00:15:11,400 --> 00:15:13,160
and Ahui's transport team

307
00:15:13,160 --> 00:15:14,220
have made no moves.

308
00:15:14,400 --> 00:15:16,330
I'm just worried about this place.

309
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:24,010
How is it?

310
00:15:24,240 --> 00:15:26,640
Did you find it following my instructions?

311
00:15:26,920 --> 00:15:27,840
You're smart.
